5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current split feels arbitrary. I want to know if our usage actually matches our share.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m tired of doing the math every month. Who is actually responsible for tracking this?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,We need to verify if the old three-person agreement still holds up for five people.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the actual numbers before I agree to any new structure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to stop arguing about money. It’s making the house feel cold.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, if we automate it, does the burden disappear? Or just shift?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, it shifts to whoever sets it up. I don’t want that to be me.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Victoria, what specific data are you looking for? I can help pull it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, I need the historical variance. I’m worried about winter spikes.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think looking at the last year’s bills would help everyone feel safer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’m concerned about the heating costs specifically. It’s a big chunk of the bill.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll look into how other houses handle this. Maybe there’s a simpler way.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I want to check the payment logs. I suspect there’s friction we’re ignoring.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’ll look at the utility statements. I need to see the seasonal swing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I’ll check the kitchen notice. I remember people complaining about the cooler.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s see what the data says. I’m open to changing the system.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,Agreed. I just want it to be low-maintenance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look into the settling up process when people moved in.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I’ll also look at the electrician quote. I need to know the upfront cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’ll look at the winter habits at another house. I want to know if they’re happier.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
